# Build the rattled Si configuration ONCE and write it to a data file.
# `displace_atoms random` is domain-decomposition dependent, so generating the
# geometry inside each run would give the 1-rank and 2-rank runs different
# systems -- which is exactly what a rank-comparison must not do.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice diamond 5.43
region box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 28.0855
displace_atoms all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 12345 units box
write_data si.data
